| Method      | Where it searches  | Syntax Example                         |
| ----------- | ------------------ | -------------------------------------- |
| Same object | On this GameObject | `GetComponent<Rigidbody>();`           |
| Parent      | Goes upward        | `GetComponentInParent<Rigidbody>();`   |
| Child       | Goes downward      | `GetComponentInChildren<Rigidbody>();` |
| Multiple    | Gets all matches   | `GetComponents<Rigidbody>();`          |
